OL,3,GNEWSARiver car teens most likely
OL,4,Adrowned, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo of three teenagers who died when
OL,7,Fthe car they were in plunged into a
OL,8,Friver most likely drowned, a coroner
OL,9,Fhas heard.
OL,11,FJackson Duke, 17, and 16-year-olds Luke
OL,12,FEtheridge and Zara Shaw died when a
OL,13,Fblack Audi A3 entered the River Wear in
OL,14,FSunderland, just before 13:30 BST on 29
OL,15,FSeptember.
OL,17,FA 17-year-old boy, who managed to reach
OL,18,Fsafety, has been released on bail
OL,19,Fpending further inquiries after being
OL,20,Farrested on suspicion of causing death
OL,21,Fby dangerous driving.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
